/E (The error 'CheckPartitionSpace partition space check failed' during Atlas 200 DK driver upgrade typically indicates that there is insufficient unallocated space of 512 MB reserved on the SD card. This issue can be caused by using an old card creation script that did not allocate enough unallocated space. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
